-- explore-kept-answers/positional.l4 with the ledger reader `is taken` in an
-- imported file (readers.l4). `taken now` still reads a ledger, so l4 explore
-- keys a state on its kept answer: 5 states, as positional.l4 explores to
-- (smucclaw/l4-ide#1107, after review: on unstable the imported reader was
-- not followed, and the two states merged into one).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT readers

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF Bob
DECLARE Mode IS ONE OF peek, skip
DECLARE Act IS ONE OF
    go HAS mode IS A Mode
    buy

GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`taken now` MEANS `is taken` FALSE

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Act
`shop` MEANS
    PARTY Bob
    MAY buy PROVIDED NOT `taken now`
    WITHIN 10
    HENCE COMMIT `taken` IS TRUE HENCE `shop`
    LEST FULFILLED

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Act
`start` MEANS
    PARTY Bob
    MAY go m
    WITHIN 10
    HENCE COMMIT `taken` IS (IF m EQUALS peek THEN NOT `taken now` ELSE TRUE) HENCE `shop`
    LEST FULFILLED

#TRACE `start` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Bob DOES go peek AT 1
    PARTY Bob DOES buy AT 2

#TRACE `start` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Bob DOES go skip AT 1
    PARTY Bob DOES buy AT 2
